<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Sprint 28d Stage 8 (S8.4) — a VERBATIM slice of the pinned upstream fork, for
  C8's clause that each operation must be demonstrated "on code we did not
  author": a fixture written for the test does not satisfy it.

  Deliberately SEPARATE from simple-maven, for the reason fork-circuit-breaker is:
  that fixture feeds roughly forty smell detectors whose counts are asserted
  elsewhere, and foreign code dropped into it would shift those baselines for a
  reason unrelated to what they measure.

  No dependencies on purpose. The slice compiles against the JDK alone, so nothing
  here can fail for a resolution reason and be mistaken for a refactoring defect.
  See PROVENANCE.md beside this file for the pin, the omissions and their reasons.
-->
